{
  "_comment": [
    "CLINC150 domain -> intent hierarchy (Larson et al., EMNLP 2019, Table 5).",
    "HuggingFace `clinc_oos` ships the 150 intent labels but not this grouping,",
    "and CLINC never published it in machine-readable form, so it is transcribed",
    "here. llm/datasets/clinc150.py validates on load that these 150 names are",
    "set-equal to the label names in the dataset, which catches any typo or",
    "omission. It cannot catch a correctly-spelled intent filed under the wrong",
    "domain -- review this file once before the first real run (SPEC D7).",
    "Domain order defines the coarse label index: banking=0 ... meta=9."
  ],
